	(text "EC11 rotary encoder breakout, panelised beside the main board.\nPull-ups and RC filters are on the main board (R22-R25, C21, C22).\nSW3 (Bourns PEC11R-4215K-S0024, LCSC C7275025) is hand-soldered: excluded from BOM and placement.\nJ11 pinout matches J7: use a straight-through GH cable."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
